TakeSell_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when units zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
├── when offer is a sell offer
│  └── it should revert with WrongOfferSide
├── when market not allowlisted for vault
│  └── it should revert with MarketNotAllowed
├── when offer tick below floor
│  └── it should revert with TickBelowFloor
├── when vault credit below units
│  └── it should revert with InsufficientCredit
├── when proceeds below min assets
│  └── it should revert with SlippageExceeded
└── when take succeeds
   ├── it should reduce the vault credit by units
   ├── it should send proceeds to the vault
   └── it should emit MidnightMarketAction withdraw
